  <text>
      <body>
        <p> IS an<expan>n</expan>si<expan>n</expan> ro fīa<expan>r</expan>f<expan>aig</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="E15">Eoch<expan>aid</expan> L<expan>et</expan>hd<expan>erg</expan> rí Laig<expan>en</expan></name> do <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Chaílti</expan></name>: ‘crēd fodera d’<name type="person" nymRef="F64">Find</name> can i<expan>n</expan> p<expan>ēst</expan> adbalmór atā acai<expan>n</expan>di a <name type="place" nymRef="g19">nGlend Ruis Enaigh</name> thes do ma<expan>r</expan>b<expan>ad</expan> seoch ce<expan>c</expan>h n-arracht ele ro dīchuir a <name type="place" nymRef="e6">hÉr<expan>ind</expan></name>?’.</p>
        
        <p>‘IS <expan>ed</expan> fodera si<expan>n</expan>’, <expan>ar</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>, ‘i<expan>n</expan> cet<expan>r</expan>am<expan>a</expan>d mír d’incind <name type="person" nymRef="M28">Mess Geghra</name> hí ⁊ ro sluic i<expan>n</expan> tal<expan>am</expan> an<expan>n</expan> hí <expan>co n</expan>dern<expan>ad</expan> p<expan>ēst</expan> adbulmōr di ⁊ ní raibi a ndán di duine da ma<expan>r</expan>b<expan>ad</expan>’, <expan>ar</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>, ‘<expan>no</expan> co tísad <addName nymRef="P1">Tāilgend</addName> do <expan>mhuintir</expan> i<expan>n</expan> clērigh sea atā <expan>ar</expan>i<expan>n</expan> cnuc ⁊ descipul dó hé ⁊ do <expan>mhuintir</expan> Rí Ni<expan>m</expan>e ⁊ Tal<expan>man</expan> é ⁊ co dísad sē re deired na i<expan>m</expan>siri ⁊ co tí i<expan>n</expan> b<expan>r</expan>āth adbulmōr do mes a<expan>r</expan> bííb ⁊ a<expan>r</expan> ma<expan>r</expan>b<expan>aib</expan>’.</p>
        
        <p>‘<hi rend="decor">C</hi>idh fodera’, a<expan>r</expan> rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> ‘a<expan>r</expan> feraib ⁊ a<expan>r</expan> <expan>con</expan>aib na fēi<expan>n</expan>di cen dul do marb<expan>ad</expan> na pīasta a<expan>r</expan>i<expan>n</expan> loch si<expan>n</expan>?’.</p>
        
        <p> ‘Lendán sídhi ro bái oc <name type="person" nymRef="F64">Find</name>’, <expan>ar</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisīn</name>, ‘.i. <name type="person" nymRef="U2">Ūaine i<expan>ngen</expan> Moghdhuirnd</name> ⁊ tuc <name type="person" nymRef="F64">Find</name> éra tochm<expan>air</expan>c uirri ara méd d’illre<expan>cht</expan>aib<note>Dot over b, looks accidental.</note> a tēighed sí ū<expan>air</expan> ní raibi bethadhach nach tēighed sī ’na richt ⁊ tāncat<expan>ar</expan> an fīan<expan>n</expan> laithe n-ōen a<expan>r</expan>i<expan>n</expan> c<expan>ar</expan>nd os cind an locha ⁊ táinic an fīadh amach a<expan>r</expan>in loch ⁊ ro ma<expan>r</expan>b<expan>us</expan>t i<expan>n</expan> pēist dā <expan>cét</expan> óglach uai<expan>n</expan>d ⁊ dā .c. cú ⁊ ro fīa<expan>r</expan>f<expan>aig</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6">Caílti</name> an<expan>n</expan>si<expan>n</expan> aroisi<expan>n</expan> d’<name type="person" nymRef="F64">Find</name>: “<hi rend="decor">c</hi>id duit-siu cen a fis dūindi i<expan>n</expan> lind tuites i<expan>n</expan> p<expan>ēst</expan> úd ⁊ dā mad lind ro tuitfed sí co cuirimais ria ⁊ <expan>co n</expan>dīghlamais a<expan>r</expan> <expan>muintir</expan> uirri?”.</p>
        
        <p>⁊ tuc <name type="person" nymRef="F64">Find</name> a ordai<expan>n</expan> fa déd fis ⁊ ro foillsiged fīr fāistine dó ⁊ ro ceiled gæ fai<expan>r</expan> an<expan>n</expan>  ⁊ it-b<expan>er</expan>t:</p>
        
        <p xml:id="FranA4_poem62"><lg type="quatrain" n="1"><l><note>It looks like something in the left margin is hidden in the binding here (…d?). Perhaps in laid ?</note>“<name type="place" nymRef="g19"><hi rend="decor">G</hi>lend Ruis Enaigh</name> bud fír da<expan>m</expan></l>
        <l>bid bind guth cluicc an<expan>n</expan> biaid tan</l>
        <l>cē raib fo damaib rūagha</l>
        <l>bidatt ili a<expan>r</expan>drūagha.</l></lg>
        
        <lg type="quatrain" n="2"><l><hi rend="decor">R</hi>o gab i<expan>n</expan> doinend duba</l>
        <l>nī soinend <expan>acht</expan> a<expan>r</expan> seala</l>
        <l>ro gab i<expan>n</expan> tal<expan>am</expan> trochull</l>
        <l>ro <pb edRef="FranA4" n="p.35"/><cb edRef="FranA4" n="p.35b"/> gab cochull cen<expan>n</expan> n-egha.</l></lg>
        
        <lg type="quatrain" n="3"><l><hi rend="decor">E</hi>nach fēi<expan>n</expan>di fadb fuiligh</l>
        <l>i<expan>m</expan>-rulaigh c<expan>ar</expan>b rer <expan>con</expan>aib</l>
        <l>sīat s<expan>r</expan>otha ellta enaigh</l>
        <l>rīan trega treghta trogai<expan>n</expan>.</l></lg>
          
        <lg type="quatrain" n="4"><l><pb xml:id="Stokes_p.69"/><hi rend="decor">T</hi>rochull fēi<expan>n</expan>di fūath cuirrigh</l>
        <l>ōs duillib rūaghaib rindib</l>
        <l>sceo gāithe ceó t<expan>ar</expan> glendaib</l>
        <l>ōs rengaib lebra a<expan>r</expan> lindib.</l></lg>
          
        <lg type="quatrain" n="5"><l><hi rend="decor">Co</hi>sc<expan>r</expan>ach at-cíu-sa i<expan>n</expan> muirbigh</l>
        <l>rosg dregai<expan>n</expan> brat da<expan>r</expan> buidnib</l>
        <l>tǣb ūai<expan>n</expan>e taitine<expan>m</expan> dædlech</l>
        <l>bud Cǣ<expan>m</expan>gen ’cā mbīa i cuibrigh.</l></lg>
          
        <lg type="quatrain" n="6"><l><hi rend="decor">M</hi>uirbech lond <name type="place" nymRef="l48">Locha hEnaigh</name></l>
        <l>tond ’na degaid ad-raigi</l>
        <l>sisi ac slaidi na fēi<expan>n</expan>di</l>
        <l>óig na fēi<expan>n</expan>di ’ca slaidhi.</l></lg>
          
        <lg type="quatrain" n="7"><l><note>note in the right margin: ‘is rand  c<expan>ru</expan>aidh a<expan>n</expan>  rand  so’.</note><hi rend="decor">D</hi>eich mbl<expan>īadn</expan>a <expan>ar</expan> dā mbl<expan>īadain</expan></l>
        <l>a n-ocht rīaghail <expan>ar</expan> rāidig</l>
        <l><expan>ar</expan> dā <expan>cét</expan> déc sēt sai<expan>r</expan>thi</l>
        <l>cosi<expan>n</expan> aidhci ro g[<expan>ē</expan>]nai<expan>r</expan>.<note>Stain, one letter illegible, presumably a tall e.</note></l></lg>
          
        <lg type="quatrain" n="8"><l><name type="place" nymRef="l48"><hi rend="decor">L</hi>och nEnaigh</name> fada ela</l>
        <l>nídat fanda na fīri</l>
        <l>tāilgen<expan>n</expan> con-taghsat i<expan>m</expan>mi</l>
        <l>bid bind canfait āilli.</l></lg>
          
        <lg type="quatrain" n="9"><l><name type="place" nymRef="l48"><hi rend="decor">Lo</hi>ch nEnaigh</name> fada ela</l>
        <l>di<expan>n</expan>d mbera it<expan>er</expan> dā b<expan>r</expan>one</l>
        <l>[e]nach<note>No distinction between the two lines; one <expan>e</expan> dropped out and an <expan>e</expan> added on the basis of all the other MSS.</note> trogai<expan>n</expan> blaī tēiti</l>
        <l>odā ’<expan>n</expan> cēiti co ’raile.</l></lg>
          
        <lg type="quatrain" n="10"><l><name type="place" nymRef="g19"><hi rend="decor">G</hi>lend Enaig</name> it<expan>er</expan> dā slīab</l>
        <l>is ē is āille it-<expan>con</expan>d<expan>ar</expan>c rīa<expan>m</expan></l>
        <l> aband dā loch ara l<expan>ár</expan></l>
        <l>isi<expan>n</expan> lán don leith aní<expan>ar</expan>.</l></lg>
          
        <lg type="quatrain" n="11"><l><hi rend="decor">B</hi>idh adba ailigthrech ūa<expan>r</expan></l>
        <l>bud adhba t<expan>r</expan>ūagh ⁊ trén</l>
        <l>bid adnacht rīgh cen<expan>n</expan> a cen<expan>n</expan></l>
        <l>ticf<expan>a</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C3">Cæ<expan>m</expan>gen</name> isi<expan>n</expan> glend. Gl<expan>end</expan>”’.</l></lg></p>
        
        <p><hi rend="decor">N</hi>í fuil āri<expan>m</expan> ⁊ ní fét<expan>ir</expan> a faisnés ⁊ ní toillend an ui<expan>m</expan>ir i<expan>n</expan> neoch ro indsed<expan>ar</expan> do dēna<expan>m</expan> dōib fēi<expan>n</expan> do gnī<expan>m</expan>aib gaile ⁊ gaisc<expan>ed</expan> ⁊ do maithib fīand <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> re tǣb dindsencais ce<expan>ch</expan>a cnuic ⁊ ce<expan>ch</expan>a forba ⁊ ce<expan>ch</expan>a ferai<expan>n</expan>d ro fī<expan>ar</expan>faiget<expan>ar</expan> .ú.<note><p><expan>Lege</expan> <expan>cóic</expan>.</p></note> ollcúicid <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> uile dīb.</p>
        
        <p><hi rend="decor">IS</hi> andsi<expan>n</expan> táinig <name type="person" nymRef="T6">Tamun Trēntrebai<expan>r</expan> m<expan>ac</expan> Tréin</name> .i. flathbrugaid cétach co<expan>m</expan>ru<expan>m</expan>ach do rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> t<expan>r</expan>ī .l. fer mór ⁊ tuigi maīle f<expan>or</expan>ro ⁊ faitiurān fīrgor<expan>m</expan> i<expan>m</expan> ce<expan>ch</expan> fer dīb ⁊ fedāna findu<expan>m</expan>a isna brataib ōsa mbruindib ⁊ lenti līcda lāngela u<expan>m</expan>pu ⁊ t<expan>r</expan>ī .l. gabal i<expan>n</expan>a lāmaib ⁊ ro b<expan>en</expan>nachada<expan>r</expan> do rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> ⁊ frec<expan>r</expan>as i<expan>n</expan> rí īat.</p>
        
        <p>‘Do fil fledh mōrcaī<expan>n</expan> mōradbul acai<expan>n</expan>d duit .i. xxx. dabach do midh ⁊ .xxx. dabach do brogóid <expan>con</expan>a lōrdōthai<expan>n</expan> do bíud leō’.</p>
        
        <p>⁊ tucsat an biad ⁊ i<expan>n</expan> lind do rí Ér<expan>end</expan> ⁊ tāncat<expan>ar</expan> dā tighib ara cūlaib.</p>
        
        <p>‘Maith a ana<expan>m</expan>, a <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>’, a<expan>r</expan> rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name>, ‘i<expan>n</expan> tech n-óla a<expan>r</expan> leith bias acut-sa ⁊ acut co<expan>m</expan>dalta .i. ac <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name> <expan>nō</expan> ’na n-éininad ré maithib fer <name type="place" nymRef="e6">nÉr<expan>end</expan></name> rachai?’.</p>
        
        <p>‘Ar cuid bīdh ⁊ lenda dūind a<expan>r</expan> leith’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisīn</name>, ‘ūai<expan>r</expan> ní lucht co<expan>m</expan>díne nā co<expan>m</expan>ai<expan>m</expan>sire dūind na dai<expan>n</expan>e atā i<expan>n</expan> <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>ind</expan></name> i<expan>n</expan>nosa’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>.</p>
        
        <p>‘<hi rend="decor">Cā</hi> lín atāthai?’, a<expan>r</expan> rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name>.</p>
        
        <p>‘Dā nōnb<expan>ur</expan>’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>, ‘.i. ix. da<expan>m</expan>-sa ⁊ .ix. do<expan>m</expan>’ <pb xml:id="Stokes_p.70"/> co<expan>m</expan>dalta’.</p>
        
        <p>‘.i. do .c. xx. dabach do mídh ⁊ do lind dīb’, <expan>ar</expan> rī <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name>.</p>
        
        <p>‘Maith a ana<expan>m</expan>, a airdrī’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name>, ‘nā cut<expan>r</expan>umaigh-siu sind do biud nā do lind caidchi ūai<expan>r</expan> i<expan>n</expan> tan do-bértha-sa .x. ndabcha da<expan>m</expan>-sa .x. ndabcha .xx. bud cōir do tobai<expan>r</expan>t d’<name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisīn</name>’.</p>
        
        <p>⁊ ro bāt<expan>ar</expan> re hed na haidhchi si<expan>n</expan> and co táinic lá <expan>con</expan>a lán soillsi cen uiresbaid bid nā lenda orra ⁊ ba cres a pupall ta<expan>r</expan> rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> isi<expan>n</expan> tulaigh tond glais ⁊ tāi<expan>n</expan>ic <name type="person" nymRef="P1"><expan>Pātraic</expan></name> <expan>con</expan>a clérchib isi<expan>n</expan> da<expan>r</expan>a leth do<expan>n</expan> pupuill ⁊ táinic rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> isi<expan>n</expan> leth ele ⁊ nír’ lēiced <expan>acht</expan> rīgh <expan>nō</expan> da<expan>m</expan>[…]na <pb edRef="FranA4" n="p.36"/><cb edRef="FranA4" n="p.36a"/> rig[…c…s…cid]<note><p>Top of the page, hard to read. ?damnae rig coicid = the heir/material of a provincial king cf. https://dil.ie/14522</p></note> isi<expan>n</expan> ūt a raibi rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēr<expan>end</expan></name> ⁊ nír’ lēiced <expan>acht</expan> espoc <expan>nō</expan> sac<expan>ar</expan>t nó m<expan>a</expan>c óighi do Rí Ni<expan>m</expan>e ⁊ Tal<expan>man</expan> isi<expan>n</expan> leth i raibi <name type="person" nymRef="P1"><expan>Pātraic</expan></name> don pupuill ⁊ suidhis <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name> a fīaghnaisi <name type="person" nymRef="P1"><expan>Pātraic</expan></name> ⁊ suidis <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name> a fīaghnaisi rīgh <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name>.</p>
        
        <p>‘<hi rend="decor">C</hi>īa agaib is sine it<expan>ruibh</expan>, a <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>’, a<expan>r</expan> rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name>, ‘.i. t<expan>us</expan>a <expan>nō</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name>?’.</p>
        
        <p>‘Is sine misi’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name>, ‘ūai<expan>r</expan> .x. mbl<expan>īadn</expan>a .xx. ro ba slán da<expan>m</expan>-sa a n-ūai<expan>r</expan> ruc<expan>ad</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name> ⁊ se<expan>cht</expan> mbl<expan>īadn</expan>a déc dó i<expan>m</expan>’ lepad-si ⁊ is as mo thigh ro gab féi<expan>n</expan>d ⁊ foirend’.</p>
        
        <p><hi rend="decor">IS</hi> andsi<expan>n</expan> ro fīa<expan>r</expan>f<expan>aig</expan> rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> dīb-siun: ‘cā lín rí do rīgaib <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> leis a tucad ferand don féind ⁊ cā rīg fēi<expan>n</expan>digh da tuc<expan>ad</expan>?’.</p>
        
        <p>⁊ frecr<expan>us</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name> co co<expan>m</expan>na<expan>r</expan>t i<expan>n</expan> c<expan>est</expan> si<expan>n</expan> ūai<expan>r</expan> ro bí a fis aige: ‘<hi rend="decor">a</hi>rdrī ro gab<expan>us</expan>ta<expan>r</expan> rīgi <name type="place" nymRef="e6">nÉr<expan>end</expan></name> da<expan>r</expan> ba co<expan>m</expan>ain<expan>m</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="F21">Ferada<expan>c</expan>h Fechtnach</name> ⁊ bāt<expan>ar</expan> dā m<expan>a</expan>c maithi aici .i. <name type="person" nymRef="T15">Tūathal</name> ⁊ <name type="person" nymRef="F46">Fīachu</name> i<expan>n</expan> an<expan>m</expan>anda ⁊ fūai<expan>r</expan> rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> bás .i. <name type="person" nymRef="F21">Ferada<expan>ch</expan> Fechtnach</name> ⁊ ro roi<expan>n</expan>dset a dā m<expan>a</expan>c <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>ind</expan></name> et<expan>ar</expan>ru .i. a seōit ⁊ a maī<expan>n</expan>e ⁊ a hindm<expan>us</expan>a, a brat ⁊ a būa<expan>r</expan> ⁊ a bótái<expan>n</expan>ti, a failgi ⁊ a fornasga, a dúin ⁊ a di<expan>n</expan>gnada ⁊ a deghbaileda don dara fir. <hi rend="decor">A</hi> halla ⁊ a hindb<expan>er</expan>a, a mes ⁊ a torad ⁊ a hecneda āilli eocha<expan>r</expan>brecca ⁊ a tuirc tāebt<expan>r</expan>oma ⁊ a heilti rūaga rōremra ⁊ a daim i<expan>m</expan>dīsciri alltaidi don fir ele’.</p>
        
        <p>‘<hi rend="decor">C</hi>āit a ndernsat i<expan>n</expan> roi<expan>n</expan>d si<expan>n</expan>?’, a<expan>r</expan> rí <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name>.</p>
        
        <p>‘Ari<expan>n</expan> cnuc sa itám i<expan>n</expan>a<expan>r</expan> suidhi do-rindset i<expan>n</expan> roind ūd’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name>.</p>
        
        <p>‘Nī hinand i<expan>n</expan> roi<expan>n</expan>d si<expan>n</expan> it<expan>ir</expan>’, a<expan>r</expan> maithi fer <name type="place" nymRef="e6">nÉr<expan>end</expan></name>.</p>
        
        <p>‘<hi rend="decor">C</hi>ā roi<expan>n</expan>d dīb is ferr lib-si?’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>, ‘.i. a fleda ⁊ a tāi<expan>r</expan>ci ⁊ a tighi isi<expan>n</expan> <expan>cét</expan> roi<expan>n</expan>d dīb? A fedha ⁊ a fāsaighi a selg ⁊ a fīadhach ⁊ a fīand coscur isi<expan>n</expan> roi<expan>n</expan>d ele?’.</p>
        
        <p>‘I<expan>n</expan> roi<expan>n</expan>d roba mesa dīb’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6">Caílti</name>, ‘da<expan>r</expan> lib-si, is ī rob’ ferr lindi dīb’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name>.</p>
        
        <p>‘INdis d’feraib <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ér<expan>end</expan></name> súd <expan>a an</expan>u<expan>m</expan>, a <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Chaílti</expan></name>’, <expan>ar</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>.</p>
        
        <p>⁊ do rāidh <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name>:</p>
        
        
